==Battleground==
*1 [[Doge Dark]] (400%) spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s (400%) spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**4 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Ovis (Enemy)|Ovises]] spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**3 [[Pokota (Enemy)|Pokotas]] spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**2 [[Coco (Enemy)|Cocos]] spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

